The graded test collection in this directory is licensed under the Creative
Commons Attribution 4.0 International License (CC BY 4.0):
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

It covers the query sets and relevance judgments (test_queries_gt_v2.jsonl,
judgments.jsonl, pool.jsonl, and the older *_v1, *_strict and *_stale_v1 files
kept for reference), the annotation protocol (ANNOTATION.md) and the cached
query embeddings in cache/.

If you use them, please cite:
  Dang Hoang Nam, "Developing an Efficient Vector Database System for
  Academic Regulation Retrieval System", KSE 2026.

The Python scripts in this directory are part of the software and are licensed
under the MIT License (../LICENSE). The regulation text quoted in these files
comes from the documents in ../data/, which belong to their issuing bodies.
